<%--

Top navigation bar for Report by Template

--%>

<%-- sticky-top, not fixed-top: a fixed bar leaves the page flow, so the heading every Report by Template page puts
     right below it slid up underneath "Report By Template". A sticky bar keeps its own space and still stays at the
     top while a long report scrolls; bg-body keeps the rows scrolling under it from showing through. --%>
<div class="navbar sticky-top bg-body border-bottom mb-2 noprint">
    <div class="container-fluid">
	    <a class="navbar-brand" href="#">Report By Template</a> <!-- oscarreport.reportbytemplate=Report By Template -->
	    <ul class="nav">
		    <li><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/oscarReport/reportByTemplate/ViewHomePage" class="contentLink">Template Library</a></li>
		    <li><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/oscarReport/reportByTemplate/rbtGroup" class="contentLink">Template Groups</a></li>
			<li><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/oscarReport/reportByTemplate/ViewAddEditTemplate" class="contentLink">Add Template</a></li>
	    </ul>
   	</div>
</div>
